a-dynasty">Shishunaga</a> replaces the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haryanka-dynasty">Haryanka dynasty</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 383 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-buddhist-council">Second Buddhist Council</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vaishali">Vaishali</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kalashoka">Kalashoka</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 345 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mahapadma-nanda">Mahapadma Nanda</a> seizes the throne and founds the Nanda Empire</span></li></ol>
